            <div xml:id="m-a713aaf2-fb13-417d-b418-559385ebd794">
              <lg xml:id="m-38bb60ff-979b-4613-a3ed-3648f4f2f5f5">
                <l xml:id="m-2f66507f-3471-41ad-b0ca-5d74049315e1" facs="#m-7ef425ef-150e-498e-8267-9c017ead1df6" label="ambiguous">207</l><l xml:id="m-b39af6be-a5b3-4742-a8e5-98eaf034288b" facs="#m-507147b5-3e8c-4189-b8fc-364daa31ca13" label="text-like">sunday at Compline.</l><l xml:id="m-59a29fe4-b8df-4588-ab68-fc8bf7fb4b76" facs="#m-cf7091ed-8063-456e-be90-eff5a8bcdc63" label="lyrics-like">2. Procul recédant sómni-a, Et nócti-um phantásma-ta:</l><l xml:id="m-52cd004e-f1f9-4fb5-9e94-b00bcad81661" facs="#m-b9bdd63b-5349-4694-aad5-1d0958b13710" label="lyrics-like">Hostémque nóstrum cómprime, Ne pollu-ántur córpora.</l><l xml:id="m-7e3e8704-c491-4920-920c-c94e08916055" facs="#m-82625a4e-99e1-40af-a8ba-6dd3f3530de4" label="lyrics-like">3. Praésta, Pá-ter pi-íssime, Patríque cómpar Uni-ce, Cum</l><l xml:id="m-d7776acb-88f8-448f-ad0f-a1ac15fdcb28" facs="#m-17024337-f043-4830-8247-1a2e1ebb17b7" label="lyrics-like">Spi-rí-tu Pa-rácli-to,</l><l xml:id="m-80460bbe-f4c7-482f-95e6-9bd2aa36a55e" facs="#m-2298ae7e-a83f-41be-bf88-e13537c32e8c" label="lyrics-like">Régnans per ómne saécu-lum.</l><l xml:id="m-300799c0-f115-4a5e-b75f-35091dc2f688" facs="#m-f7331913-8378-409c-9316-80d4611f79fd" label="ambiguous">A-men.</l><l xml:id="m-ada07594-c67b-48c2-8961-bee65c958c4a" facs="#m-8936551e-cd79-4852-bd03-7b2e228dfb72" label="text-like">2. On Solemn Feasts</l><l xml:id="m-7e18402c-c7d3-44d7-bfe0-41bfdccde85f" facs="#m-c43a436b-dcbc-4bcd-a5ab-dfda1111fb2e" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-dc68f3ba-70c8-4efc-b79b-9393ccc48a51" facs="#m-d84b2b4d-0af7-4014-bb68-a8239f6bd261" label="ambiguous">T</l><l xml:id="m-856549ab-a149-41e2-bd67-782b108e2392" facs="#m-99403c16-0cc0-4c78-a9fa-fa26297c46e8" label="lyrics-like">E lúcis ante térmi-num, Rérum Cre-á-tor, pósci¬</l><l xml:id="m-c2a61343-7b36-4300-8ec3-ec7f4626fd0f" facs="#m-4126ea9b-f5c8-4888-ac55-dba3a15fe28a" label="lyrics-like">mus, Ut pro tú-a cleménti-a, Sis praésul et custódi¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-0a255263-6a7f-4aa4-a85d-d34460fb9bee" facs="#m-f2134700-ce56-4ce3-addb-d2041f346716" label="lyrics-like">2. Procul re-cé-dant sómni¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-e8bdcbf7-434d-4da6-b33e-8257bca56d54" facs="#m-54f67ed3-7890-4d26-aa38-104f3c1303da" label="lyrics-like">Et nócti-um phantásma¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ba6ba82-36a0-462e-8013-d00c0131485b" facs="#m-bb1c256a-7eb7-4d4e-a8f6-598cf6686a9d" label="lyrics-like">ta: Hostémque nóstrum cómprime,</l><l xml:id="m-317642fd-d956-431a-8a98-94d0c2efbe6d" facs="#m-adeee1f7-aff4-4633-bd73-cc9bff8e3413" label="lyrics-like">Ne pollu-ántur cór¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
